===========
Compilation
===========

This project can be compiled using the provided Makefile.
A C++ compiler supporting c++11 is needed.

Just run the following command inside the project folder:

$ make

=========
Operation
=========

=====
Notes
=====

This project uses the c++11 standard library instead of calling libc or any
system calls directly.

Line breaks are done by printing "\n" instead of using "std::endl" to
avoid unnecessary flushes of the output buffer.

No C-style casts.